## Title: Forge's Ledger: Kill Ledger
## Notes: How many of each mob you have killed, what they drop, how often, and what it all sells for to a vendor. Optional companion to Forge's Ledger; your numbers also show on the Ledger dashboard. Type /kl to open it.
